+# Revenue Pipeline — Operator / wholesale kit
+
+**Primary channel: Etsy digital download** — use `etsy-digital-product/` and `npm run build-etsy`.
+
+This folder is for **direct B2B operator licenses** (custom deals, not the standard Etsy ZIP). Etsy buyers get `DIGITAL-LICENSE.txt` and `START_HERE.md` instead of a signed operator agreement.
+
+## What the licensee receives
+
+| Layer | Description |
+|-------|-------------|
+| **Runtime** | Node API, CRM, operator dashboard, landing page |
+| **Automation** | n8n workflow JSON (discovery + follow-up) |
+| **GTM** | Unified 10-lead batch, give-before-ask PDFs, LinkedIn post #1 |
+| **Delivery** | Service catalog, MSA/SOW templates, pricing sheet |
+| **Docs** | Go-live runbook, white-label checklist, handoff checklist |
+
+## Build the zip (from repo root)
+
+```bash
+./operator-license-kit/scripts/build-operator-kit.sh
+```
+
+Output: `dist/hunter-operator-license-kit-YYYYMMDD.zip`
+
+Ship that zip + a **license agreement** you define (see `LICENSE_TERMS_TEMPLATE.md`—not legal advice).
+
+## Onboarding flow (you → licensee)
+
+1. Sign operator license (fee + support terms).
+2. Send zip + `config/brand.env.example` filled with their brand.
+3. Licensee runs `scripts/apply-white-label.sh` (optional automation).
+4. Licensee deploys per `GO_LIVE_RUNBOOK.md` with **their** Supabase, Resend, Cal.com.
+5. Handoff call: CRM tour, seed batch, first 4 PDF sends.
+
+## Support boundaries
+
+See `docs/SUPPORT_BOUNDARIES.md` — define what you fix vs what they own (keys, domain, compliance).
+
+## File index
+
+See `MANIFEST.yaml` for every path included in the zip.
